    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Current Use",
            "paragraphs": [
                "A rare chance to see behind the scenes at the newly located Brick Sixty Studio on Roman Road.",
                "This stock brick Victorian shop with accommodation above, was refurbished this year by Architectural Workshop.",
                "Now home to Brick Sixty, who design and make products in the form of the much-loved London brick – looking to support local makers & craft in the UK. Their hand cast products symbolise London and are stocked at unique stores. Just like the city itself, all our products are designed to be completely inclusive and crafted for all to enjoy.",
                "Established by Billy, an engineer living in London with a passion for the character and materiality of the humble brick. Brick Sixty set out to uncover and tell the stories behind the bricks, the buildings and the streets of London.",
                "Brick Sixty now also collaborate with fellow London and UK based makers to celebrate more of the high-quality design and thoughtful manufacturing that takes place across the country."
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "What's On",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Free access to the studio.",
                "Free Brick Sixty postcard for all visitors.",
                "Products available to purchase.",
                "Bespoke engraving."
            ]
        }
